# Max history row_end exactly on an interval boundary. A boundary value
# start + k*i belongs to partition k, so k+1 history partitions are
# needed. Here start=00:00, interval 1 hour, max history row_end=02:00:00
# belongs to p2 = [02:00, 03:00).
